		{"id":"custom","type":"text","text":"## Custom teal island\n\nSeparated from the dense grid to validate long curved connectors and custom color preservation.","x":1350,"y":430,"width":470,"height":260,"color":"#14b8a6"},
		{"id":"overflow","type":"text","text":"## Deliberate overflow\n\nThis paragraph is longer than the available card. It should be clipped cleanly and must never paint over the node below or beyond the rounded border. Repeated content increases pressure on wrapping and height calculations. Repeated content increases pressure on wrapping and height calculations.","x":-300,"y":780,"width":420,"height":180,"color":"1"},
